@faction_strength
title: Building the right
subtitle: Build up our party's right wing.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and gysi_advisor == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pragmatist_strength += 1.5*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); pragmatist_dissent -= 1*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); gysi_advisor_fame += 2; beweli_dissent += 1.5; oldleft_dissent += 1.5;

We have strengthened the party's right wing, favoring a pragmatist and reform-oriented approach to politics. While our move has found many supporters, our left wing feels under attack.

@moderate_party
title: Moderate our stance
subtitle: Push <span style="color: #BC2D72;">Die Linke</span> towards the center.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and gysi_advisor == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; social_moderation += 0.4*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); foreign_moderation += 0.6*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); econ_moderation += 0.6*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); pragmatist_dissent -= 1*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); greens_relation += 2*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); spd_relation += 2*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); cdu_relation += 1*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); beweli_dissent += 4; oldleft_dissent += 4; gysi_advisor_fame += 2;

We have slightly moderated our views, bringing ourselves closer to the center. The moderate parties notice and appreciate our move, but our left wing disapproves.

@defend_democracy
title: Promote democracy
subtitle: Democracy and our Constitution come before all, even socialism.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pragmatist_strength += 1*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); emali_strength += 1*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); pro_status_quo += 2*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); gysi_advisor_fame += 2; oldleft_dissent += 2; spd_relation += 0.5*(gysi_advisor_fame/100); 

We have reasserted our committment to democracy. The moderate parties approve.
